{"title": "Status properties/IsInvulnerable", "pageid": 35214, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/IsInvulnerable", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>IsInvulnerable</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_IsInvulnerable\">List of conditions with IsInvulnerable</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Astrally_Projected\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrally_Projected_(Condition)\" title=\"Astrally Projected (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astrally Projected\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Astrally_Projected_(Condition)\" title=\"Astrally Projected (Condition)\">Astrally Projected</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>While your body resides in the cold expanses of the Astral Sea, you have projected a likeness of yourself here for the evening.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Eternally_Bound\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eternally_Bound_(Condition)\" title=\"Eternally Bound (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eternally Bound\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Eternally_Bound_(Condition)\" title=\"Eternally Bound (Condition)\">Eternally Bound</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cazador will not let this spawn die - it is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li>\n<li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Ketheric_Thorm)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Ketheric Thorm) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Ketheric_Thorm)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Ketheric Thorm) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Ketheric is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> against all damage while he has the Nightsong imprisoned.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Otiluke's_Resilient_Sphere\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere (Condition)\">Otiluke's Resilient Sphere</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected creature is enclosed in an arcane sphere and can neither be damaged by attacks or effects from outside the sphere, nor can it damage anything outside the sphere. The affected creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is halved.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Possessing\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Possessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Possessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Possessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Possessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Possessing (Condition)\">Possessing</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity cannot be targeted by spells or attacks until the creature it has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Malefic Possession (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Possessed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Malefic Possession (Condition)\">Possessed</a> dies or is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Turned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\">Turned</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Shadow_Visage\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Visage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Visage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Visage (Condition)\">Shadow Visage</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This visage is floating in shadowy limbo. It cannot be damaged until drawn into combat.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Silvered_Bulwark\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silvered_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvered Bulwark (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silvered Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Silvered_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvered Bulwark (Condition)\">Silvered Bulwark</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage. This protection is shared by every creature and object within the barrier.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Soul_Echo\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Echo_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Echo (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Echo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Echo_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Echo (Condition)\">Soul Echo</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>While this companion's body is gone, their soul lingers on and can be used to resurrect them.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Spectral_Observer\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectral_Observer_(Condition)\" title=\"Spectral Observer (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectral Observer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spectral_Observer_(Condition)\" title=\"Spectral Observer (Condition)\">Spectral Observer</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Though you are too dangerous to mingle in person, Withers has allowed you to observe this gathering - but only observe.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Stasis\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stasis_(Condition)\" title=\"Stasis (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp/29px-Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp/44px-Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/27/Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stasis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp/29px-Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Stasis_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Stasis_(Condition)\" title=\"Stasis (Condition)\">Stasis</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A headless corpse preserved through esoteric magic.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Welcome_Spectre\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_Spectre_(Condition)\" title=\"Welcome Spectre (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Welcome Spectre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_Spectre_(Condition)\" title=\"Welcome Spectre (Condition)\">Welcome Spectre</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Withers has plucked your spirit briefly from beyond the grave to observe this party - but only observe.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715012936\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3120/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46107/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8458/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 845883/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.862      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   55.862      1 -total\n 55.71%   31.118     13 Template:ConditionsTableRow\n 51.68%   28.871     13 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 49.48%   27.643     13 Template:Icon_link\n 47.55%   26.564     13 Template:Icon_text\n 38.41%   21.457     26 Template:Trim\n 20.47%   11.435     13 Template:Ifempty\n 10.01%    5.593     